  "description": "26\" Electric Chopper Cruiser - 500W Motor & 48V Battery\nThe Twenty5 26\" Chopper Cruiser E-Bike is an electric bicycle released by Micargi to commemorate its 25th anniversary. It features an 18\" size and a Tracer Hi-ten steel Classical Chopper Cruiser Stretch Cruiser frame, giving it a unique and stylish look.\nFor improved suspension, the bike is equipped with a Tracer Triple Tree alloy fork measuring 28.6x25.4x222mm. It also has a comfortable Tracer steel hi-rise handlebar measuring 11\" in height and 27\" in width, providing a comfortable riding experience.\nIn terms of performance, this bike is powered by a 48V 500W high-speed brushless rear hub motor, capable of reaching a maximum speed of 22 miles per hour. It comes with an LG lithium battery with a capacity of 48V/17.5Ah, offering long-lasting power support. The LED display allows you to conveniently monitor the battery level and other relevant information.\nFor safety during rides, the bike is equipped with 180mm disc brakes for reliable stopping power. Steel fenders are also included to prevent mud and water from splashing onto the rider, ensuring a cleaner riding environment.\nAdditionally, the Twenty5 26\" Chopper Cruiser E-Bike comes with quality accessories such as a durable steel seatpost and a classical cattlehide leather saddle with springs, enhancing comfort and overall quality.\nOverall, the Twenty5 26\" Chopper Cruiser E-Bike is an impressive electric bicycle that captivates cycling enthusiasts with its unique design and excellent performance. Whether for daily commuting or leisurely rides, this bike provides an outstanding riding experience.\nHEADSET Steel Diameter 1-1/8x30xH34mm\nFENDERS;Steel",
